    .map(t -> "(" + t.f0 + "," + t.f1 + ")")
    .addSink(new FileSink<>(outputPath));
```

## Using AppBase Pattern for Testing

The AppBase pattern allows swapping sinks for testing:

```java
public class AppBase {
    public static SinkFunction out = null;

    public static SinkFunction<?> sinkOrTest(SinkFunction<?> sink) {
        if (out == null) {
            return sink;
        }
        return out;
    }
}

